      "updated": 1783660506075,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "To sort an ArrayList  there is a method called sort() belongs to\nCollections class .\n\nCollections.sort( ArrayList_ref )\n\nIt sort the ArrayList in Natural Order.\nNatural Order means:\n\nIf ArrayList is of Integers then sorting is in numeric order\nIt ArrayList is of Strings then sorting is in lexicographical order (alphabetical order)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "To sort an ArrayList  there is a method called sort() belongs to\nCollections class .\n\nCollections.sort( ArrayList_ref )\n\nIt sort the ArrayList in Natural Order.\nNatural Order means:\n\nIf ArrayList is of Integers then sorting is in numeric order\nIt ArrayList is of Strings then sorting is in lexicographical order (alphabetical order)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
